         <property name="text">
          <string>### FET Installer

####

This will install FET for the current user, by default in a local applications folder.

If the default installation is selected, the application can be registered so that a file-type association and file-type icon are set up.

Alternatively, FET may be installed to another folder without registration, which would allow multiple installations.</string>
         </property>
